# MLflow (Milestone 10)
#
# The local file store lives at mlruns/ and holds tracking metadata plus
# copies of run documents. It is regenerated by 'mlflow-log' and
# 'mlops-demo --mlflow'; nothing in it is source. Any local tracking
# database is excluded too, though this project configures none: a
# database backend would need the full 'mlflow' distribution, which pins
# pandas<3.
mlruns/
mlflow.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# DVC (Milestone 10)
#
# .dvc/config, .dvc/.gitignore, .dvcignore, dvc.yaml, and params.yaml ARE
# source and must stay tracked -- they are the pipeline definition.
#
# dvc.lock IS tracked, and is byte-stable: a fresh `dvc repro` from the
# same source, uv.lock, configuration, seed, and parameters leaves it
# unchanged. Every declared output is deterministic by construction, and
# the timestamped Milestone 5-8 provenance is deliberately not declared.
# A modified dvc.lock after a reproduction means something genuinely
# changed. See DEC-100 and DEC-104 in docs/DECISIONS.md.
.dvc/cache/
.dvc/tmp/
.dvc/config.local

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Claude Code
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
